  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f569197effff78d02f3a38bbca8264a9829fa94.png\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/406779ed74e4af09e2ee99a86dbc5647f4279748.png\" alt=\"website\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d6e77f84a99064679bbc806c06a23d46a74d2ed.png\" alt=\"faithful32x\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/BertSa/Faithful32x-VisibleNetherBiomes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3753fba32acea8f6054b9ed99f79f76ffc030e20.png\" alt=\"github\"></a></p>\n<p>將下界屋頂（Y=128）的基岩改為依生態系而定的紋理。使用此資源包即可視覺化生態系的邊界，再也不用開啟令人困惑的 F3 畫面了！此為 voxelity 所開發之 Visible Nether Biomes 的高解析度改版。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f31c55b44a4ffb77d2b4c141b54b23ba425b771.jpeg\" alt=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c9b4128144933cd59317139955d64ed5eba4828a.jpeg\" alt=\"2\"></p>\n<h2>相依套件</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db19c00de9b206d4d01ffb3cdead7b54076339fb.png\" alt=\"continuity\"></a></p>",
